{"2818630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trucker Joe 2", "steam_appid": 2818630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different trucks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Trucker Joe, you build up your own freight company. You start with an old, weak truck, but later on, with your hard-earned money, you can buy some seriously cool rigs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/a3f198d28a320f09e881ea5240cb4d03.poster.avif?t=1779992375\" width=618 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/a3f198d28a320f09e881ea5240cb4d03.webm?t=1779992375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/a3f198d28a320f09e881ea5240cb4d03.mp4?t=1779992375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You place the companies on the map!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should strategically consider where to place each company to avoid unnecessary detours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/93f4ec3655ebfb3798c775c47957cbc3.poster.avif?t=1779992375\" width=618 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/93f4ec3655ebfb3798c775c47957cbc3.webm?t=1779992375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/93f4ec3655ebfb3798c775c47957cbc3.mp4?t=1779992375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different companies require specialized trailers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every type of cargo needs the right trailer! Whether it's delivering heavy construction equipment or frozen pizza, you’ll need the right trailer for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/5d15cc5ecbe2077ae02e2a7b481ecd20.poster.avif?t=1779992375\" width=618 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/5d15cc5ecbe2077ae02e2a7b481ecd20.webm?t=1779992375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/5d15cc5ecbe2077ae02e2a7b481ecd20.mp4?t=1779992375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different trucks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Trucker Joe, you build up your own freight company. You start with an old, weak truck, but later on, with your hard-earned money, you can buy some seriously cool rigs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/a3f198d28a320f09e881ea5240cb4d03.poster.avif?t=1779992375\" width=618 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/a3f198d28a320f09e881ea5240cb4d03.webm?t=1779992375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/a3f198d28a320f09e881ea5240cb4d03.mp4?t=1779992375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You place the companies on the map!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should strategically consider where to place each company to avoid unnecessary detours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/93f4ec3655ebfb3798c775c47957cbc3.poster.avif?t=1779992375\" width=618 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/93f4ec3655ebfb3798c775c47957cbc3.webm?t=1779992375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/93f4ec3655ebfb3798c775c47957cbc3.mp4?t=1779992375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different companies require specialized trailers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every type of cargo needs the right trailer! Whether it's delivering heavy construction equipment or frozen pizza, you’ll need the right trailer for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/5d15cc5ecbe2077ae02e2a7b481ecd20.poster.avif?t=1779992375\" width=618 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/5d15cc5ecbe2077ae02e2a7b481ecd20.webm?t=1779992375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/5d15cc5ecbe2077ae02e2a7b481ecd20.mp4?t=1779992375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Become a tycoon in Trucker Joe 2! Expand your fleet with trucks and trailers to keep industries moving. In this mix of simulation and strategy, you decide where companies are built, plan wisely, shorten your hauls, and dominate the logistics market!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Indonesian<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Romanian<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/ee410a152919f35284ebafcd51bb5a10fcb4bb8a/header.jpg?t=1779992375", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/a2b19b101d4aacddd7905c27117e51795047156f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779992375", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/a2b19b101d4aacddd7905c27117e51795047156f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779992375", "website": "http://www.truckerjoe.net", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window 10 32bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 gen 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4600</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 650</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Sundrum Development"], "publishers": ["Sundrum Development"], "demos": [{"appid": 3629540, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}, {"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://sh